{"3997970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Camelot Unchained", "steam_appid": 3997970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Base Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Base Edition of <i>Camelot Unchained</i> offers a complete introductory experience, with everything you need to join your Realm, master your class, and fight in the war. Jump in at a lower price point, and upgrade to War Unending at any time to unlock the full roster of content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Note</i></strong><i>: At this stage of Early Access, the </i>CU<i> game servers will typically be available from Friday to Monday. Once we have completed the shift to servers maintaining full weekly availability, it is our intent to implement a monthly subscription fee. All players will have advance notice of this change, and will need to opt into paying the subscription.</i></p></p><br><h1>War Unending Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To experience the full breadth of what <i>Camelot Unchained</i> has to offer, the War Unending Edition will provide players with a complete experience that you can upgrade to at any time. This edition of the game includes access to all new content that will be introduced to the game over the course of Early Access and into the full release of <i>CU</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Note:</i></strong><i> Existing </i>CU<i> Backers (e.g., those who purchased not through Steam) will be provided with access to this edition of the game through the </i>Unchained Launcher <strong><i>at no additional cost</i></strong>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shattered World. Three Realms. War Unending.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Camelot Unchained</i> is the long-anticipated PvP-focused MMORPG made by Unchained Entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge your allegiance to one of three unique Realms fighting in a world wracked by the Veilstorms, supernatural disasters that have broken continents and left what land remains in a constant state of flux and turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stake Your Claim. Carve Your Path. Defend Your Realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of 3 factions each with 3 playable races with their own benefits, drawbacks, and quirks. Choose from over twenty purpose-built classes across seven distinct archetypes, with hundreds of abilities for you to master on your journey to conquer the world of Camelot Unchained. Work with the members of your Realm to build a well-rounded force capable of vanquishing your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/cb1ebd0ecf4bbfb04f8b535cc8d3ad4b.poster.avif?t=1781799101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/cb1ebd0ecf4bbfb04f8b535cc8d3ad4b.webm?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/cb1ebd0ecf4bbfb04f8b535cc8d3ad4b.mp4?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put the MASSIVELY in MMORPG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revel in large-scale battles supporting thousands of players at any given time, requiring planning and execution to seize the advantage over your opponent. Strike an alliance of convenience with another Realm to face a more powerful enemy, or wait for the right moment to strike during an ongoing battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/3e0da2bd99b45ecd0cc3d010d42a1ec7.poster.avif?t=1781799101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/3e0da2bd99b45ecd0cc3d010d42a1ec7.webm?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/3e0da2bd99b45ecd0cc3d010d42a1ec7.mp4?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Realms. Master the Wilds. Overcome the Guardians.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hand-crafted zones and discover the riches that await you. Battle powerful guardians across ancient ruins and dangerous encampments to harvest valuable resources, allowing you to craft better and more powerful equipment. Level an extensive set of Professions with in-depth crafting mechanics to produce weapons, armor, jewelry, reagents, potions, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/c9428b7b43f7ceb106e984827c1f2169.poster.avif?t=1781799101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/c9428b7b43f7ceb106e984827c1f2169.webm?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/c9428b7b43f7ceb106e984827c1f2169.mp4?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shattered World. Three Realms. War Unending.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Camelot Unchained</i> is the long-anticipated PvP-focused MMORPG made by Unchained Entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge your allegiance to one of three unique Realms fighting in a world wracked by the Veilstorms, supernatural disasters that have broken continents and left what land remains in a constant state of flux and turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stake Your Claim. Carve Your Path. Defend Your Realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of 3 factions each with 3 playable races with their own benefits, drawbacks, and quirks. Choose from over twenty purpose-built classes across seven distinct archetypes, with hundreds of abilities for you to master on your journey to conquer the world of Camelot Unchained. Work with the members of your Realm to build a well-rounded force capable of vanquishing your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/cb1ebd0ecf4bbfb04f8b535cc8d3ad4b.poster.avif?t=1781799101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/cb1ebd0ecf4bbfb04f8b535cc8d3ad4b.webm?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/cb1ebd0ecf4bbfb04f8b535cc8d3ad4b.mp4?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put the MASSIVELY in MMORPG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revel in large-scale battles supporting thousands of players at any given time, requiring planning and execution to seize the advantage over your opponent. Strike an alliance of convenience with another Realm to face a more powerful enemy, or wait for the right moment to strike during an ongoing battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/3e0da2bd99b45ecd0cc3d010d42a1ec7.poster.avif?t=1781799101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/3e0da2bd99b45ecd0cc3d010d42a1ec7.webm?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/3e0da2bd99b45ecd0cc3d010d42a1ec7.mp4?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Realms. Master the Wilds. Overcome the Guardians.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hand-crafted zones and discover the riches that await you. Battle powerful guardians across ancient ruins and dangerous encampments to harvest valuable resources, allowing you to craft better and more powerful equipment. Level an extensive set of Professions with in-depth crafting mechanics to produce weapons, armor, jewelry, reagents, potions, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/c9428b7b43f7ceb106e984827c1f2169.poster.avif?t=1781799101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/c9428b7b43f7ceb106e984827c1f2169.webm?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/extras/c9428b7b43f7ceb106e984827c1f2169.mp4?t=1781799101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In Camelot Unchained, three Realms battle for control over resources, dominance on the battlefield, and eternal glory. Enter the world of the long-awaited spiritual successor to classic RvR MMORPGs to stake your claim on the future with large-scale Realm vs. Realm combat, crafting, and all out war.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/3ca5aec02472b5dafea52527f8ced609f5175513/header.jpg?t=1781799101", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/107ec84ab02b0413b56b0a6d3aeec32ff0f73121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781799101", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997970/107ec84ab02b0413b56b0a6d3aeec32ff0f73121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781799101", "website": "https://www.camelotunchained.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon RX580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 24 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700k or AMD Ryzen 7 3700x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 or AMD Radeon RX 6650 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 32 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended":